{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54698","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔（京本一作「时」），如鼠树枝（京本一作「林」）间。\n又似鸡形双（京本一作「头」）翅举（京本作「颐颈势」），看（京本作「举」）看洪水作爲（京本作「危」）难，移寨向（京本作「上」）高山。\n（京本此首两见。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}